This license covers the source code, assets and other files in this
repository, together called "Stroke" below.

1. Using the code. You are free to read, copy, modify, build, run and reuse
   Stroke, in whole or in part, for any purpose. The only conditions are the
   ones in sections 2 and 3.

2. Credit. If you publish anything based on Stroke, you must say clearly,
   somewhere people will see it, that it is based on Stroke.

3. Published apps. If you publish a compiled app that includes code or files
   taken or adapted from Stroke (a "Published App"), all of the following
   apply:

   a. No malware. The Published App must not contain malware or any hidden
      harmful behavior.

   b. Payments stay with Stroke. The Published App must be free for its
      users. Stroke's trial, license-key activation and payment systems must
      stay in it unchanged, switched on, working as designed, and paying the
      author of Stroke. This condition does not apply if the Published App
      adds so much new work, or changes Stroke so substantially, that it is a
      distinct product in its own right. Removing, bypassing or replacing
      those systems, renaming or restyling the app, and other surface-level
      changes never count toward that on their own.

   c. A different name. The Published App must not be called "Stroke", and
      its name and icon must not be close enough to Stroke's that users could
      take it for Stroke.

4. No warranty. STROKE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
